- @title = 'Agencies · Nitrous'
- @html_class = 'light'
- @body_id = 'agencies'
- @body_class = 'story'


.page
  .page-hero
    .container
      = render partial: 'layouts/webnav', locals: { active: 'education' }
      .hero-copy
        h2
          | Nitrous and Agencies
        h3
          | Lightning-fast development in the cloud: spin up and maintain
          br
          | multiple projects with different clients effortlessly



  article.featurette.offset-visual
    .container
      
      .full-visual
        = image_tag 'home/ide-theme-split-5.png', width: '970px', alt: 'Nitrous Editor themes'

      .box-wrapper.three.centered
        .box
          .visual
            = image_tag 'home/large-featurette-seconds.svg', class: 'visual', alt: 'Zero-to-Code in Seconds'
          h3.section-title Zero-to-Code in Seconds
          p Spin up a complex development environment for any app, language or stack in seconds. Work with your favorite local tools and existing workflow. Nitrous enables you to work on any project/stack a new client may require without wasting time with setup and maintenance.
        
        .box
          .visual
            = image_tag 'home/large-featurette-containers.svg', class: 'visual', alt: 'Manage Multiple Projects in the Cloud'
          h3.section-title Manage Multiple Projects in the Cloud
          p With a multi-container workspace, you can juggle multiple projects without breaking a sweat, even if each requires a unique, complex dev environment to operate. Leave the heavy lifting to us, while you focus on building products that your clients would love.
        
        .box
          .visual
            = image_tag 'home/large-featurette-share.svg', class: 'visual', alt: 'Showcase your Project with Clients Instantly'
          h3.section-title Showcase your Project with Clients Instantly
          p Preview and test your app hosted instantly in the cloud at no costs. Upgrade to a paid plan to acquire custom domains once the app is ready for the world.



  article.colored.rails.quote
    .container

      blockquote
        = image_tag 'home/quote-klabnik-logo.png', class: 'visual', alt: 'Steve Klabnik'

        p
          | I know how to administer a computer well enough.&nbsp;
          strong But I don't want to
          | . Nitrous.IO allows me to just say "I want to code some Rails now, kthx" and not have to worry about getting all the details straight. Sometimes, I care about the details, but most of the time, I don't.
        cite
          | Steve Klabnik
          span , Rails Core Committer & prolific Open Source contributor


  article.colored.wilsonsmith.quote
    .container

      blockquote
        = image_tag 'home/quote-wilsonsmith-logo.svg', class: 'visual', alt: 'Wilson & Smith'
        p
          | I love the vision. It has been prophesied by the forefathers of UNIX that a day would come in which our computers would simply be a piece of glass connected to some computer on the network. 
          strong Nitrous.io is making that dream a reality
          |. Practically speaking, the feature that captivates my attention is that I have 
          strong easy SSH access to a Linux machine 
          | that someone else is maintaining. Among all of my responsibilities, personal system administration is something that I am keen on delegating. If I never have to worry about keeping a machine online and its state secured, then I will be winning.
        cite
          | Ryan Smith
          span , Consultant at Wilson & Smith



  = render 'layouts/cta'

= render partial: 'layouts/footer', locals: { active: 'education' }
